Provides: storage-provisioner
Description: declarative storage provisioning executor (YAML-driven)
 sprov reads a YAML specification describing a storage topology as a
 directed acyclic graph (hardware, partitions, RAID, LUKS, LVM,
 filesystems) and either executes the operations in topological order
 against live block devices, or emits a busybox-compatible POSIX
 shell script that performs the same operations when invoked.
 .
 Useful in rescue/installer environments where reproducible, auditable
 storage provisioning is required.

